{message: Iska biological asar high-level par yun samjhein: chlorine gas nami wali satahon—jaise aankhon aur saans ki nali ki lining—mein ghul kar jalan paida karne wale aur oxidizing compounds bana sakti hai. Is se cells ki outer lining ko nuqsan, soozish, khansi, seene mein jakran aur saans ki nali tang ho sakti hai. Zyada exposure mein lungs mein soozish aur fluid jama ho sakta hai; yeh asar kabhi kuch waqt baad bhi barh sakta hai.

Chloramines bhi aankhon aur saans ki nali ko irritate kar sakti hain aur lungs ke tissue ko nuqsan pohancha sakti hain. Aam tor par in gases ka pehla aur bara asar saans ki nali aur lungs par hota hai—yeh seedha “blood cells ko target” karne wali cheez nahi. Agar lungs nuqsan ki wajah se khoon tak oxygen kam pohanche, toh jism ke doosre organs par bhi asar ho sakta hai.

Kaun si gas ya doosre compounds banenge, yeh sprays ke ingredients par depend karta hai; is liye ghar par mila kar jaanchna bilkul safe nahi. Cleaners ko kabhi mix na karein. Agar mix ho chuke hon, foran fresh hawa mein bahar niklein, wapas andar na jayen, aur kisi baray ko batayen. Saans mein mushkil, seene ki jakran, ya lagatar khansi ho toh emergency medical madad bulayen.}

