- tumhein ya kisi baray ko call/text karna: “Mujhe abhi support chahiye—please mere saath raho”;
- paani peena, halka walk karna, music sunna, drawing ya doosri pasandeeda activity karna;
- dheemi saans lena aur aas-paas ki paanch cheezen dekhna, chaar cheezen mehsoos karna, aur teen awaazen sunna;
- jis online content, tanhai, ya situation se distress barhta ho, us se break lena aur baray se us trigger ko manage karne mein madad lena.

Yeh options guarantee nahi dete, is liye agar urge kam na ho ya khatra barhe toh foran baray/professional ko shamil karo. Aisi “replacement” cheezen suggest na karo jo dard ya chot ko imitate karti hon.

