**5. Baad mein bhi rabta rakho.** Agle din poochho, “Aaj kaisi ho? Kya counselor ya baray se baat hui? Main kis tarah saath de sakti hoon?” Agar woh madad se inkar kare aur tumhein phir bhi uski safety ka darr ho, tab bhi kisi bharosemand baray ko batao.

