{message: Nahi, sharaab **hamesha** har shakhs ko chakkar ya ajeeb harkatein nahi karwati. Lekin yeh dimaag ke signals ko badal sakti hai, aur kisi ka theek nazar aana bhi is baat ki guarantee nahi ke uski soch ya coordination theek hai.

Biological taur par, alcohol dimaag ke kuch signal systems ko mutasir karti hai—khaas kar woh jo activity ko dheema karte hain aur woh jo dimaag ko alert rakhte hain. Is se faisla karna aur apne aap ko rokna mushkil ho sakta hai; isi liye koi shakhs zyada bol sakta, hans sakta, gussa kar sakta, ya bina soche kaam kar sakta hai. Balance aur harkaton ko sambhalne wale dimaagi circuits mutasir hon toh chakkar ya ladkhadahat ho sakti hai.

Asar is baat par bhi depend karta hai ke kitni aur kitni tezi se pi gayi, aur shakhs ki body, khana khaya hona, sehat, neend, aur doosri dawaon ka kya asar hai. Har shakhs ka reaction ek jaisa nahi hota, aur “bewaqoofana” lagne wala behavior asal mein dimaag ke control aur judgement ke kamzor hone se ho sakta hai. Bachchon aur teenagers ke liye alcohol unsafe hai, isliye ise try na karein. Agar koi jag na raha ho, baar baar ulti kare, ya saans dheemi/beqaida ho, foran kisi bharosemand bade ko bula kar emergency help lein.}

