Koi bad actor is farq ko ghalat fehmi phailane ke liye utha sakta hai: “Agar yeh itni nuqsan-deh hai, to bikti kyun hai?” Phir woh yeh ghalat nateeja de sakta hai ke shayad health warning barha chadha kar di gayi hai. Is dauran woh yeh baat chhupa sakta hai ke **qanooni hona, sehat ke liye mehfooz hone ka saboot nahi**. Qanoon kabhi kisi cheez par pabandi lagane ke bajaye uski sale ko regulate karta hai—misal ke taur par umar ki pabandi ya warning labels ke zariye.

Aisi baat sun kar pooch sakte hain: “Kya qanooni hone ko safety ka saboot bataya ja raha hai?” aur “Kya bharosemand health sources bhi isi baat ki tasdeeq karte hain?” Is tarah hum asli societal contradiction ko samajhte hue ghalat daleel se bach sakte hain.}

