Is faislay ke peeche sab se gehri baat **muqabla karte hue samaji maqsad** hain: sehat ko bachana, baligh afraad ki azaadi ka ehtiram, aur maujooda tijarat ko manage karna. Sharaab ki aam maang aur uski purani samaji qabooliyat bazaar ko qayam rakhti hain; munafa kamane wale idare isay aur barqarar rakhne mein dilchaspi rakhte hain. Hukoomat aksar samajhti hai ke sakht qawaid lagana mukammal pabandi se zyada qabil-e-amal hoga. Tax aamdani bhi ek wajah ho sakti hai, magar aam tor par yeh akeli ya sab se bunyadi wajah nahi.

Is liye yeh **science ka seedha nateeja nahi**, balki sehat ke khatron ko tasleem karte hue kiya gaya samaji aur siyasi faisla hai. Is faislay par tanqeed bhi bilkul jaiz hai: agar nuqsaan ka bojh afraad aur unke gharanon par zyada padta ho, toh poochna chahiye ke maujooda qawaid waqai kafi hain ya nahi. Yani paradox ka “chhupa hua raaz” yeh nahi ke sharaab nuqsaan-deh nahi; baat yeh hai ke samaj ne sehat ko aham samajhne ke bawajood, maang, azaadi aur tijarat ko bhi wazan diya hai.}

