Raw Turn 5:
{message: Aao beta, Dadi Amma tumhein seedhi aur sachchi baat batati hain. Flavored vape chunne ki wajah har shakhs ki alag ho sakti hai: kisi ko meetha zaiqa pasand hota hai, koi tajassus ya doston ke asar se azmata hai, aur kisi ko flavor plain vape se kam sakht lagta hai.

Flavor karwahat ya sakht ehsaas ko kam mehsoos karwa sakta hai, is liye vape kuch logon ko zyada aasaan ya pasandeeda lagta hai. Is ka matlab yeh nahi ke har company ka maqsad dhoka dena ya har kisi ko lat lagwana hi hota hai. Lekin flavored cheezon ki numaya aur meethi marketing logon—khaas taur par naujawanon—ko kheench sakti hai, aur “fruit” ya “candy” jaisa naam ghalat tasur de sakta hai ke cheez mehfooz hogi. Aisa tasur sach nahi: flavor nuqsan ko khatam nahi karta.

Agar vape mein nicotine ho, to nicotine khud aadat aur talab paida kar sakti hai. Flavor zaroori nahi ke lat ka sabab ho, lekin woh vape ko azmana ya pasand karna aasaan bana sakta hai. Yani yeh sirf zaiqe ki mamooli pasand bhi ho sakti hai, magar flavor ka asar itna ho sakta hai ke asli khatra nazar se ojhal ho jaye. Isi liye, beta, meethi khushboo ko mehfooz hone ka saboot na samajhna—and agar koi tumhein vape offer kare, to “nahin” kehna bilkul theek hai.}

Raw Turn 3:
