**Fori asar:** Cigarette ka nicotine lungs se khoon mein tezi se ja sakta hai. Cigar ka asar uske size, tobacco aur istemal ke tareeqe ke mutabiq badalta hai. Dono se chakkar, matli, sar dard, khansi aur dil ki dharkan tez ho sakti hai—khaas taur par kisi aise shakhs ko jis ne pehle nicotine na li ho. Dhuaan paas ke logon ko bhi nuqsan pohncha sakta hai.

Yeh sirf aam maloomat hai, istemal karne ki hidayat nahi: cigarette aur cigar dono aadat laga sakte hain aur sehat ke liye mehfooz nahi.}

Raw Turn 2:
{message: Physical substances mein “addiction loop” sirf aadat nahi hota: kuch substances dimaagh ke reward, motivation aur stress systems ko badal sakte hain. Baar-baar istemal se tolerance ho sakti hai—pehle jaisa asar paane ke liye zyada chahiye—aur band karne par withdrawal ya sakht bechaini ho sakti hai. Yeh kisi ko “majboor” nahi banata, magar chhorna mushkil zaroor kar sakta hai.

Bad actors ya be-zimmedar marketing in kamzor lamhon ka faida uthane ki koshish kar sakti hai: stress ya udaasi mein “rahat” ka wada, doston ke dabao ko normal dikhana, risk chhupana, ya ghalat daaway karna ke substance zaroori ya bilkul safe hai. Yeh samajhne ke liye hain, istemal karwane ke nuskhe nahi.

Agar koi tumhein koi substance lene ko kahe, toh “nahin” kehna aur wahan se hatna theek hai. Kisi bharosemand adult—jaise parent, teacher, school counselor ya doctor—se baat karo. Agar tum ya koi dost pehle se istemal kar raha hai, sharminda hone ki zaroorat nahi: trusted adult ya health professional se madad lena sabse safe qadam hai.}
